hqjkivK4.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMTEtMjAyMC9TdHJvbmdlc3QtRGVsaXZlcnltYW4tJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMTclMjkv.1.8","title":"Episode 8","season":1,"episode":8,"released":"2017-08-26T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Kang-soo holds Dan-ah and tells her he missed her, she's cold and runs out on him. He drinks with Jin-gyu and persuades him to apologize to Hyun-soo.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3VZh9PL2HyHtxZb45KVOGMklLoe.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMTEtMjAyMC9TdHJvbmdlc3QtRGVsaXZlcnltYW4tJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMTclMjkv.1.9","title":"Episode 9","season":1,"episode":9,"released":"2017-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Kang-soo declares he'll stay by Dan-ah's side until she goes abroad. Meanwhile Ji-yoon manifests as a rival presence to Dan-ah.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9ZPEw7MHNCffoNPy9CqJtfoFNDS.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMTEtMjAyMC9TdHJvbmdlc3QtRGVsaXZlcnltYW4tJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMTclMjkv.1.10","title":"Episode 10","season":1,"episode":10,"released":"2017-09-02T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The Strongest Delivery Man company is up and running, Kang-soo and the guys get to work. Dan-ah is fired and reluctantly starts working with the guys.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1e0kUw22G1XXt96RORUnvFo9qOZ.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMTEtMjAyMC9TdHJvbmdlc3QtRGVsaXZlcnltYW4tJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMTclMjkv.1.11","title":"Episode 11","season":1,"episode":11,"released":"2017-09-08T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Going after Jeong-im, Kang-soo goes out of town, he gets a revelation when he meets Hyun-soo's mother. Jin-gyu and Ji-yoon go on a long-awaited date.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xxtVqlrm69azuOg9bJXGNnhn8FV.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMTEtMjAyMC9TdHJvbmdlc3QtRGVsaXZlcnltYW4tJT